              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "The student found that there was no increase in the rate of photosynthesis when two identical lamps were placed 5 cm from the beaker.",
                "source": {
                  "qp": 15
                }
              },
              {
                "type": "text",
                "text": "Suggest why there was no increase in the rate of photosynthesis.",
                "source": {
                  "qp": 15
